// The command queue's count and its registered occupancy (issue #181;
// REQ-NOT-001, REQ-NOT-002), readable from the bench: every build's
// invariant monitor checks cmdq_nempty_r == (cmdq_count_r != 0) at each
// clock edge (section OC). Nothing here changes the RTL.
`verilator_config
public_flat_rd -module "KL_aecp_notify" -var "cmdq_count_r"
public_flat_rd -module "KL_aecp_notify" -var "cmdq_nempty_r"
